{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123649","id":4582488782,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABESM6zg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123649","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123649.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123649.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123649","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123649/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123649/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123649/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ecd9128538645985dedacf747dfe6eb1bc8a482a","number":123649,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix orthographic position reconstruction and reflections in GI","user":{"login":"JakLuminth","id":50899632,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwODk5NjMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50899632?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth","html_url":"https://github.com/JakLuminth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The shared GI pass reconstructs mirrored X/Y positions for single-view orthographic cameras and uses perspective-style viewing directions for their reflections.\r\n\r\nUse the existing inverse-projection path and parallel viewing directions for orthographic cameras. Together, these changes remove the reported VoxelGI shadow artifact and SDFGI lighting bands in the supplied reproduction projects.\r\n\r\nFixes #69784.\r\nFixes #60522.\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\nBuilt unmodified and patched Windows editors from `57277407e77e61b161f35dbd7aeb510f7a9e26a6` and compared them on an AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT using Vulkan Forward+, at 800 × 600.\r\n\r\n- Both original reproductions checked at full and half GI resolution, including camera rotation and translation.\r\n- VoxelGI: the orange shadow line is removed at the tested animation positions (0, 2.5, and 5 seconds).\r\n- SDFGI: the horizontal bands are removed and remain absent after 30 additional seconds of stationary rendering at full GI resolution.\r\n- No visible regressions in perspective, asymmetric-frustum, or synthetic two-view SDFGI captures.\r\n- Both builds succeeded; C++/GLSL formatting and `git diff --check` passed.\r\n\r\nVoxelGI stereo validation was blocked by the same 2D/2DArray texture-binding error in both builds. Stereo tests used synthetic GPU views, without a headset.\r\n\r\nAI was used to generate the patches.\r\n\r\n## Before and after\r\n\r\nVoxelGI, full GI resolution, animation at 2.5 seconds.\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| ![VoxelGI before](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cbe794a1-9279-4827-91ff-b47d98efe6a6) | ![VoxelGI after](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c9b89c53-b80b-42dc-97eb-8db6754f3a46) |\r\n\r\nSDFGI, full GI resolution, after 30 additional seconds of stationary rendering.\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n| --- | --- |\r\n| ![SDFGI before](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2824d052-9063-4f0c-afd4-93dc9b54e408) | ![SDFGI after](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6f0abad3-f5f1-4d6c-b34c-30d902441862) |","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-20T05:17:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-20T14:56:51Z","closed_at":"2026-09-20T14:56:44Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"81593712e1a9c5617ccd986a71008e53087c33af","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"JakLuminth:fix-orthographic-gi","ref":"fix-orthographic-gi","repo":null,"sha":"ecd9128538645985dedacf747dfe6eb1bc8a482a","user":{"login":"JakLuminth","id":50899632,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwODk5NjMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50899632?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth","html_url":"https://github.com/JakLuminth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JakLuminth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},"base":{"label":"godotengine:master","ref":"master","repo":{"id":15634981,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNTYzNDk4MQ==","name":"godot","full_name":"godotengine/godot","owner":{"login":"godotengine","id":6318500,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjYzMTg1MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6318500?v=4